{#- Article share icons (copy link, Facebook, X, Reddit) for the current page. Shared by the
    article4 byline (ArticleAuthorShare4.njk), the Share This Article box (ArticleShareThis.njk)
    and the In This Article nav's share icons (ArticleInThisArticleNav.njk, navShare). Styled by
    css/Article/article-share-icons.css. -#}
<div class="social-share">
  <a class="share-icon share-icon--link" href="https://www.usms.org{{ permalink }}" aria-label="Copy link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  <a class="share-icon share-icon--facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://www.usms.org{{ permalink }}" aria-label="Share on Facebook" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  <a class="share-icon share-icon--x" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https://www.usms.org{{ permalink }}" aria-label="Share on X" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  <a class="share-icon share-icon--reddit" href="https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https://www.usms.org{{ permalink }}" aria-label="Share on Reddit" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-brands fa-reddit-alien" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</div>
